      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can confirm that I was unable to get testing avatars to work on SDK 3.10.1 (oddly its showing 3.5 on Unity package manager, but its the latest from the vrc website), I am running on Arch Linux but I did get uploading to work by making sure I have Windows Build Support installed on Unity.\n\nHowever the Symbolic link to the VRChat Directory did not work either, and I didn't get similar error output before trying it like White Lotuz.",
